== Trivia ==
*{{Rmt|&7Learning a way home...}} was displayed over '''The Lost Adventurer''''s head.<!--
*Before '''The Lost Adventurer''' was added to the Main Network, the response to selecting {{Rmt|&c[The High Level]}} was just {{Rmt|&dHmmm...}}.-->
*'''The Lost Adventurer''' was the only NPC to have its dialogue and location changed so often.
*'''The Lost Adventurer''' was the only NPC with a [[SkyBlock Levels|SkyBlock Level]] above their head. 
**The NPC's level was {{Rmt|&8[&a82&8]}} while at {{Coordinates|-94|75|-132}}.
**The NPC's level was {{Rmt|&8[&9127&8]}} while at {{Coordinates|-156.5|76|-169.5}}.
*'''The Lost Adventurer''' 'found their way home' and was replaced by the {{NPCSprite|Lone Adventurer}} in {{zone|The End}} once the island was revamped.
**The [[NPC]] had been teasing an update to the island throughout its existence.

